<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Motd</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>motd</a>
</pre>
<p>Shows the message of the day again: the message you see when you log on, 
where the administrators tell everyone what's new or what's coming. Handy 
when it scrolled past too quickly.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help News</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>
</pre>




</div>